This database contains information from DR Tulu RL Data, which is made available
under the Open Data Commons Attribution License (ODC-BY) 1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/

The upstream dataset card credits OpenScholar and SearchArena prompts and
GPT-4.1-generated rubrics. Original source labels and the immutable upstream
revision are recorded in manifest.json. ScholarQA rows are retained as identified
by those labels. Source questions and rubric fields have not been rewritten.
The import adds row indices, question hashes, source aliases and split labels.

The imported data retains ODC-BY; the repository MIT license does not replace it.
The source card describes intended research and educational use in accordance
with Ai2's Responsible Use Guidelines: https://allenai.org/responsible-use
